..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : LIMA.ARCHIVE
.. Author         : saac
.. Verantwortlich : teamreport
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Functionality  : Defines parameters to create a document using mask context.
.. xpartner = supplier the future document record is linked to
.. ATTENTION: This program must not call fo command .end. Each error handling
..            must take place outside this fop. Example see ev/VORGANG.SPERR
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue END ? _F|defined(M|lief)
..
.. Declarations
.type VP16 xpartner ? _F|defined(U|xpartner)
..
.. Define parameters
.assign U|xpartner = M|lief
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
